\par\b\fs30 3. Implemented architecture map\b0\fs22\par
\par
\par\b\fs26 Current implemented request path\b0\fs22\par
\par
flowchart LR\par
    A[Browser<br/>HTML/CSS/JS] --> B[FastAPI app/main.py]\par
    B --> C[Raw body + upload limits<br/>app/upload_limits.py]\par
    C --> D[Format / request validation]\par
    D --> E[app.worker.execute]\par
    E --> F[Private worker service<br/>app/worker_service.py]\par
    F --> G[Bounded child process]\par
    G --> H\{Operation engine\}\par
    H -->|Core PDF tools| I[pypdf toolkit<br/>app/toolkit.py]\par
    H -->|DOCX/PPTX conversion| J[Gotenberg adapter<br/>app/gotenberg.py]\par
    J --> K[Private Gotenberg 9<br/>LibreOffice]\par
    I --> L[Output validation]\par
    K --> L\par
    L --> M[FastAPI response]\par
    M --> N[Browser download]\par
    N --> O[Optional<br/>Use result in another tool]\par
\par
\par
\par\b\fs26 Container/network trust boundary\b0\fs22\par
\par
flowchart TB\par
    Internet -->|HTTP to localhost/reverse proxy| API[PDF Studio API]\par
    API -->|internal network only| WORKER[Private worker]\par
    WORKER -->|internal network only| GOT[Gotenberg]\par
    WORKER -. blocked public egress in CI .-> X[Public Internet]\par
    GOT -. no published host port .-> X\par
\par
\par
Important implemented controls:\par
\par
- Worker has no public host port.\par
- Gotenberg has no public host port.\par
- Processing network is internal in Compose.\par
- Worker/Gotenberg run with read-only filesystem/root restrictions and resource limits.\par
- CI verifies non-root identity, read-only code filesystem and blocked public egress.\par
- Request adapters disable environment proxies and redirects.\par
- Gotenberg endpoint is operator configuration, not user request data.\par
- PR #19 additionally rejects public converter hostnames.\par
\par
This is meaningful isolation, but it is not a perfect hostile-document VM sandbox.\par
