\par\b\fs30 22. Definition of "done" for a feature\b0\fs22\par
\par
A feature is not complete merely because the engine exposes an API.\par
\par
A strong acceptance gate includes:\par
\par
- real code,\par
- correct API/UI integration,\par
- synthetic and edge-case tests,\par
- negative/security tests,\par
- actual output reopened and validated,\par
- expected text/pages/structure checked,\par
- browser flow where relevant,\par
- worker/isolation path preserved,\par
- license/security review,\par
- docs updated,\par
- limitations stated,\par
- required CI green.\par
\par
Only then can it be TESTED. SHIPPED requires broader release/production evidence.\par
